[center][size=5][b]Faster Settlement Construction Fanfare[/b][/size]
Shortens the slow CONSTRUCTION COMPLETE reveal after a settlement building finishes.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
When a settlement building finishes upgrading, the game plays a 10 second reveal cutscene with a CONSTRUCTION COMPLETE banner and fireworks. This shortens that cutscene to 1 second, so you get the banner and get back to the settlement.

[b]What it does not do[/b]
Build timers, judgement timers, production rates and everything else in the settlement globals are left alone. Pair it with a settlement timer mod if you also want faster builds.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies [i]GLOBALS/GCSETTLEMENTGLOBALS.GLOBAL.MBIN[/i] only. It conflicts with any other mod editing the settlement globals, including timer mods and full settlement overhauls[/*]
[*]The patch is minimal: one value and nothing else[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS [/*]
[/list]

Built for Forsaken. Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].
Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/faster-settlement-construction-fanfare]https://github.com/SavageCore/faster-settlement-construction-fanfare[/url]
